acyclic-graph	gates	Enforces the decomposition DAG (loopzero-contracts ◄── engine/cloud/cli); no import cycle.
adapter-ports	gates	Every adapter declares at compile time which port it satisfies.
advisory-lock-scope	gates	Forbids session-scoped pg_advisory_lock; only pg_advisory_xact_lock is allowed.
agpl-isolation	gates	Verifies AGPL-licensed code stays isolated from proprietary import paths.
alert-runbooks	-	Every Prometheus alert has a linked runbook annotation.
anonymous-auth	gates	Forbids anonymous/unauthenticated access on protected API surfaces.
argo-app-identity	gates	The ArgoCD Application name is derived only from naming.ArgoAppName (dropping the project made two projects of a tenant collide on one Application).
base-image-digest	gates	Base images are pinned by digest, not floating tags.
baseline-compare	-	Compares a captured steady-state baseline against the current state.
baseline-update	-	Updates the committed steady-state baseline artifact.
billing-layers	gates	Billing layers must be enumerable and owned; closed debt without coverage fails.
billing-secrets	gates	Billing secrets must not have literal optionality; the decision is made by value.
caddy-host-parity	gates	A hostname the edge check requires needs a site block that terminates TLS.
caddyfile-csp	gates	Operator-local edge Caddyfile invariants (prod-bundle app-dev with a CSP superset of the dashboard meta CSP, preserved headers, auth-dev rate limits, trusted proxies).
caddyfile-dev-server-deny	gates	Defense-in-depth: app-dev block MUST 404 dev-server-only paths (/src/*, /.env, /@vite/*, /node_modules/*, /vite.config.*). Regression protection for loopzero-cloud#141.
caddyfile-no-docker-ip	gates	Blocks hardcoded 172.18.x.x Docker network IPs in infra/local/Caddyfile + enforces canonical https://127.0.0.1:8443 upstream in both wildcard blocks (M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-caddyfile-no-docker-network-ip_test.sh — closes Red Team loopzero-cloud#127 guard).
canonical-fixture-repo	gates	Rejects legacy loopzero-repotest fixture in LIVE test/seed scripts; canonical is getloopscale/loopzerokit-example (M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-canonical-fixture-repo_test.sh).
chart-default-tags	gates	loopzero-owned charts must not default their image tag to a mutable ref (#232).
chart-pairs	gates	No chart exists twice across infra/helm and charts/ — by name, or as a template-identical copy under another name.
check-allowlist-sunsets	gates	Every exemption in rules/code-review-allowlist.txt carries a sunset, and on that date it stops exempting anything
cli-exit-codes	gates	Enforces the permanent CLI exit-code contract (0/1/2/3/4/5 only).
cluster-rename-guard	gates	Proves the cluster rename (B-001: mgmt->core, vault->secrets) touched only cluster identifiers. Asserts every line a pre-rename baseline classified GENERIC still exists byte-for-byte — `vault` carries 74 such lines naming OpenBao, `mgmt` carries zero. Refuses to run when the baseline cannot be proven an ancestor of HEAD, because a baseline captured after the first edit compares the new state with itself and passes forever. T0.1 of plans/cluster-rename-core-secrets-plan.md.
cluster-role-no-secrets-star	gates	Forbids unconditional cluster-wide secrets/configmaps RBAC grants.
clusterimagepolicy-mode	gates	Validates the sigstore ClusterImagePolicy enforcement mode.
contract-consumers	gates	Verifies cross-repo contract consumers stay in sync with the contract.
corrections-txt-closed	gates	Asserts CORRECTIONS.txt items are all closed.
correlation-header	gates	Correlation-ID header is forwarded across the request path.
cosign-cutover	-	Enforces the cosign keyed→keyless cutover deadline ratchet.
cost-series-producers	gates	B-181: every loopzero_* series the loopzero-cloud cost aggregator queries has a declared producer here, or a tracked absence.
coverage-diff	-	Diffs test coverage against a baseline to catch regressions.
coverage-merge	-	Merges per-package coverage profiles into one report.
crd-semantic-diff	gates	Semantic diff of CRD schemas to catch breaking spec changes.
credentials-sot	gates	T1.1 SoT drift audit — every Secret created by canonical generator scripts (generate-secrets.sh, generate-build-secrets.sh, generate-runtime-secrets.sh, provision-api-tokens.sh) MUST be enumerated in docs/operations.md. Also asserts 4 mandatory drill env vars + Chart-hardcoded credentials section + Rotation playbook section. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/docs/credentials-sot_test.sh.
dangling-data-refs	diff	Detects data/file references that no longer resolve after a change.
dangling-script-refs	diff	Detects shell-script references that no longer resolve after a change.
dashboard-promtool	gates	Validates Grafana dashboard + Prometheus rules via promtool.
dashboard-root-parity	gates	The dashboard runbook must name the path the edge actually serves.
db-generated-boundary	gates	MA-7 Gate A: no services/routes/server imports internal/db/generated.
decisions-deletion	gates	Guards deletion of decision/ADR records.
dev-public-billing-portal-syntax	gates	Hermetic contract for infra/tests/e2e/live/dev-public-billing-portal_test.sh — 8 assertions (bash -n / strict-mode / log+assert / billing endpoint / exit-code contract / allowlisted). M20 T2.1 Wave A gate 1/18.
dev-public-env	gates	Locks dev-public.yaml canonical shape: publicAuthUrl/publicCloudUrl/uiBaseUrl/dashboardOrigin point to *-dev.loopzero.example, cookieDomain=loopzero.example, CORS + allowedReturnUrls cover both dev hosts with trailing-slash variants, no localhost or legacy non-dev URLs leak, D5 OAuth reuse (no _DEV env var override), Stripe webhook per-env split documented. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/helm/dev-public-env_test.sh.
dev-public-oidc-redirect-syntax	gates	Hermetic contract for infra/tests/e2e/live/dev-public-oidc-redirect_test.sh — 10 assertions (bash -n / strict-mode / log+assert+test_provider / OIDC provider ref / Kratos browser flow path / exit-code / allowlisted). M22 T2.1 Wave A gate 2/17.
dev-public-loopzero-external-secrets-overlay	gates	Locks post-T1.2 workload-identity contract for infra/helmfile/values/dev-public/loopzero-external-secrets.yaml.gotmpl (enabled=false safe default, K8s-auth shape, no legacy AppRole roleId/secretRef, canonical mgmt DNS, EC-1/EC-2 traceability). M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-dev-public-loopzero-external-secrets-overlay_test.sh.
divergence-matrix	gates	Checks the local-vs-prod divergence matrix is current.
dockerfile-no-docker-hub	gates	Forbids unqualified docker.io/Docker Hub base images.
docs-contract-refs	gates	Every .claude/rules/*.md reference in CLAUDE.md and every ADR-NNNN cited in a Go comment resolves (or has an exception with a deadline).
domain-sink-purity	gates	Ratchet: the services DAG sink must not grow its persistence surface (B-049).
drill-creds-isolation	-	Ensures DR-drill credentials are isolated from production.
drill-outputs-consumers	gates	Verifies drill Pulumi-output consumers use the canonical schema.
ecosystem-validators	gates	Runs `check_xrefs.py` and `test_e2e_smoke.py`, which the golden-rule change protocol requires green and which no gate ran (B-129). Reports FAIL and WARN SEPARATELY: adding them would let the warning erase the failure.
english-only	gates	Everything git tracks is written in English; a line keeps Portuguese only with an inline exemption that states its reason.
error-vocabulary	gates	An authored error message must not carry an internal term forbidden by Rule 3.
feature-fence	gates	Deny-by-default fence over api/internal by feature: registered features, kernel and composition roots; HTTP and adapter packages stay inside their feature.
git-diff-to-lines	-	Utility: converts a git diff into a changed-line set for other gates.
gomod-auth-org	gates	The org build files authenticate to matches the org go.mod requires (a drift makes git fetch unauthenticated and GitHub answer 'not found').
helm-diff-structural	-	Structural pre-sync Helm diff to catch drift before apply.
helm-topology-index	gates	Index of which chart runs on which cluster, derived from the helmfiles (never a hand-written second copy).
helmfile-context-parity	gates	A task that invokes a helmfile targets the cluster that helmfile declares (B-044).
install-git-hooks	gates	Validates the M8 1.5 pre-push hook + installer canonical shape + idempotency (M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-install-git-hooks_test.sh).
k6-load-rigor	gates	k6 load-harness rigor: dropped_iterations Counter threshold in `base` (EC-2), L5 distributed manifest shape (TestRun kind + pinned image + secretKeyRef + no inline secret, EC-1 YAML validity), k6:distributed:l5 task wired, README per-level runner doc. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-k6-load-rigor_test.sh.
ldflag-symbols	gates	Refuses a `-X` ldflag injection whose import path or symbol does not resolve on disk — the linker accepts it silently and the binary keeps its default (B-053).
lint-coverage	gates	Every Go module is measured (lint + gofmt), with a per-module ratchet against regression.
loki-retention-schema	gates	Trio-compat regression for T8.2 Loki retention_stream schema: infra/helm/loki/values.yaml parses cleanly + deploymentMode SingleBinary (cleanroom-compatible) + exactly 1 retention_stream entry + selector secrets-system + period 2160h + priority int (Loki startup schema) + default retention_period 168h. 7 assertions. Uses gopkg.in/yaml.v3 (already-vendored, per plan D2 parsimony rung 4). M-Migrate2 2026-07-10 M16 T3.2 Wave 2 replaces infra/tests/check-loki-retention-schema_test.sh.
loki-vault-retention	gates	T8.5 archive CronJob for Loki vault-audit logs (kind + schedule 04:00 UTC monthly + concurrencyPolicy Forbid + runAsNonRoot + capabilities drop ALL + logcli/mc invocation + AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY secretKeyRef + loki-archive-s3-creds Secret + secrets-system NS target). The T8.2 retention rule is owned by loki-retention-schema. M-Migrate2 2026-07-10 M16 T3.1 Wave 2 replaces infra/tests/check-loki-vault-retention_test.sh.
ma7-status-locality	gates	MA-7 Gates B+C: sqlc status funcs + SafeTransition only in db/store/.
migration-test-coverage	-	Every DB migration has corresponding test coverage.
mock-budget	gates	Caps the number of mocks per test (SRP smell budget).
module-selfcontained	gates	Every Go module must build without go.work, which is what CI does.
no-aes-remaining	-	Calendar-gated: fails on remaining AES code paths post-transit migration.
no-cloud-dev-default	gates	T1.1 hermetic guard of plan m1-commit-canonical-30-fixes: no test/seed script in archive/canonical-tests-v1/scripts/local/, infra/tests/e2e/, or infra/scripts/local/ may declare a default env-var value pointing at cloud-dev.loopzero.example (Caddy 301 redirect trap post commit ee77b8da 2026-06-22). EC-1 absorption: /api/v1/webhooks/github handler is single exception (Caddyfile 142-156). M-Migrate2 2026-07-10 M16 T2.3 Wave 1 replaces infra/tests/check-no-cloud-dev-default_test.sh.
no-env-vault-secrets	gates	Forbids secrets-as-env-var regression after the ESO/OpenBao migration.
no-legacy-sa-token-secret	gates	Forbids legacy kubernetes.io/service-account-token Secrets.
no-migrate-force	gates	Forbids forced/destructive DB migration operations.
no-new-bash	diff	Blocks new .sh files not in the shell-scripts allowlist.
no-pulumi-inline-secrets	-	Forbids inline secret literals in Pulumi code.
no-shell-wrap	gates	Forbids thin shell wrappers around pure-logic that belongs in Go.
oidc-cred-admin-loopzero	gates	Rejects fabricated paulo@loopzero.test/LoopZeroDev2026! credentials; canonical is admin@loopzero.example/loopzero-dev-password (M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-oidc-cred-admin-loopzero_test.sh).
openbao-bootstrap-in-core-task	gates	Forbids installing the secrets plane into the mgmt cluster: fails the bootstrap-in-core task and any secrets helmfile pointed at a mgmt context, across every taskfiles/*.yml (B-047, ADR 2026-08-12-openbao-in-core-rule-vs-task).
openbao-init-auth-mounts	gates	T5.1-T5.9 openbao-init auth mounts + per-binary roles: every k8s-* mount in authMethods declared once and rendered (k8s-core, k8s-build, at least one k8s-cell-*) + loopzero-api TTL 1h on k8s-core + loopzero-tenant/app/preview/platform-operator roles on k8s-core + argo-workflows on k8s-build + external-secrets-broker on each cell + isolation invariants (loopzero-api NOT on cells, ESO-broker NOT on core). Advisory when helm absent. M-Migrate2 2026-07-10 M16 T3.7 Wave 2 replaces infra/tests/check-openbao-init-auth-mounts_test.sh (Wave 2 COMPLETE).
option-b-eso-deploy-doc	gates	Locks docs/operations/option-b-mgmt-helmfile-eso-deploy.md contract (4 sub-paths named, B1 recommended, B4 rejected, canonical commands + rollback + decision matrix + cross-references present, ESO version drift check against runtime helmfile). M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-option-b-eso-deploy-doc_test.sh.
orphan-alerts	gates	Detects Prometheus alerts with no owning dashboard/runbook.
ory-kratos-lifespan	gates	Locks canonical self-service flow lifespans in infra/helm/ory-kratos/values.yaml.gotmpl: login=10m + registration=10m + recovery=15m (defense pair with edge rate_limit for Red Team #89 email-bomb closure). Section-scoped stricter than bash grep -A N (sibling lifespan can NOT leak). M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/helm/ory-kratos-lifespan_test.sh.
ory-kratos-public-urls	gates	Hermetic helm-template golden test for Ory Kratos serve.public.base_url + CORS + cookie.domain + allowed_return_urls + dashboardRoute-mapped ui_url across standalone-public + dev envs. Advisory-fallthrough when helmfile absent. M22 empirical follow-up (the ONLY M22 target allowlisted — delivers allowlist -1).
package-admission	gates	B-058: the k8s plumbing package admits no domain vocabulary, and every home of the split stays populated.
pkg-usage-matrix	gates	Verifies the pkg/ cross-component usage matrix is current.
platform-cr-namespace	gates	Tenant/Environment CRs in a versioned manifest must live in loopzero-system.
postgresql-pdb-config	gates	Validates the PostgreSQL PodDisruptionBudget configuration.
prod-image-digests	gates	Production manifests reference images by digest.
prod-image-tags	gates	Forbids mutable :latest-style image tags in production manifests.
proxy-exposure	gates	Every edge reverse_proxy declares what it lets through.
publish-hygiene	gates	No LIVE versioned file carries a workstation path. A dated record is exempt by design (docs/README.md forbids rewriting it). The IP half of the sibling loopzero-rag gate was NOT carried over: against this tree it produced 104 findings, almost all false (version strings, Cloudflare CIDRs, the declared live target). B-130.
pulumi-required-secrets	gates	T1.5 — every Pulumi.<env>.yaml enumerates required secret keys (as `secure:` entry OR comment). Prod=6 keys, staging=4, drill=3 (DO token via env var per D7' sponsor override). Cross-checks prod keys also appear backticked in docs/operations.md. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/docs/pulumi-required-secrets_test.sh.
quarantine-protect	diff	Protects the canonical-tests-v1 quarantine from accidental edits.
readiness-summary	gates	The readiness summary is the last status mutation before persisting, in all six reconcilers.
records-tree-split	gates	One records tree is written; the retired one stays frozen (a second live tree accumulates half the truth).
regression-matrix	gates	Verifies the regression-test matrix covers required scenarios.
regression-test	-	Asserts a regression test exists for tracked fixed bugs.
render-schema-gen-sql	gates	T0.2 sqlc schema render pipeline: ephemeral PG16 + golang-migrate replay + pg_dump inside container + post-process (drop ALTER OWNER TO, banners, SET, restrict, orphan --, collapse blanks, trim trailing WS) + sqlc compile pre-flight with throwaway probe. Default check-only mode validates toolchain + migrations dir. Pass --render for destructive pipeline. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/scripts/ci/render-schema-gen-sql.sh.
route-auth-coverage	gates	Enforces R2-F8 (HIGH) — every api/internal/server/router.go route MUST be inside middleware.Auth group OR registerProtectedRoutes OR explicit public-allowlist. Locates group ranges via brace-counter, enumerates r.{Get,Post,Put,Patch,Delete,Method}( calls. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-route-auth-coverage_test.sh.
runbook-parity	gates	A token-rotation message must not name the ServiceAccount the runbook forbids.
runtime-slo	-	Validates runtime SLO definitions and thresholds.
scheduled-image	gates	Autonomous execution (scheduled or event-driven) must not use an image of ours that has no publication path in this tree.
script-count	gates	Tracks the total shell-script count against the reduction target.
scripts-audit	-	Audits shell scripts against the allowlist ledger.
security-context	gates	Enforces pod securityContext (non-root, limits, probes).
service-auth-rotation	-	Enforces the Ed25519 service-auth key rotation cadence.
shell-hygiene	gates	Lints shell scripts for strict-mode and hygiene rules.
shellcheck-advisory	gates	Advisory shell-lint gate — runs shellcheck across infra/scripts/local + infra/tests/check-*-syntax_test + infra/tests/e2e/live/dev-public-*. Tolerates SC1091/SC2155/SC2086/SC2046. Advisory-only fallthrough when shellcheck not installed (WARN + exit 0). M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/scripts/local/shellcheck-advisory.sh.
silent-surface	gates	Ratchet: refuses a NEW router surface guarded by `if cfg.X != nil` that does not report whether it was registered (B-104). Baseline may fall, never rise.
skill-paths	gates	T0.1 EC D5: every infra/scripts/ path AND every `task X` invocation cited in any .claude/skills/*/SKILL.md MUST resolve on disk. Ports the bash awk task-name extractor + flattened/namespaced include set walk into Go. Skips task-automation skill (generic third-party). Enforces dogfood no-GH_TOKEN/.env + to-plan no-`task teardown` anti-patterns. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/skills/skill-paths_test.sh.
skill-script-paths	gates	Every script invocation in a SKILL.md resolves in BOTH ecosystem layouts (.claude/ in the plugin, the root in the standalone kit). A bare path breaks in one of them, and which one depends on how the ecosystem was installed (B-120).
skill-suites	gates	Runs the pytest suites under .claude/skills/*/tests/, which no task ran. Advisory when pytest is absent; FAILS when discovery finds no suite, because finding nothing is not the same as finding nothing wrong; SKIP where the gitignored kit is not installed, with the reason printed (B-124).
skip-link	gates	Every t.Skip/it.skip carries an issue URL (or lives in *_skip_test.go).
spotcheck-dimension	-	Spot-checks a maturity-audit dimension against evidence.
sqlc-sync	gates	Committed sqlc generated/ is in sync with the schema codegen.
sqlc-tx-prop	gates	Enforces pool-bound vs tx-bound query propagation inside withEnvironmentLock.
stack-coverage	gates	Verifies the tool-inventory stack-coverage claims via grep.
status-writer-contract	gates	Refuses a bare Status().Update anywhere in operators production code, including the local-alias and SubResource spellings (ADR 2026-08-12-status-writer-contract, B-085).
stdlib-only	gates	The shared vocabulary package must not import outside the standard library.
taskfile-interface	gates	Validates the Taskfile public-interface contract.
template-compliance	-	Checks documents comply with their canonical templates.
tenant-csp-passthrough	gates	Static-CSP Traefik middleware must not be attached to tenant routes (#59).
tenant-predicate	gates	Enforces the multi-tenant isolation predicate (security veto-backed).
test-coverage-report	gates	Hermetic coverage gate for infra/tests/{unit,charts}/... — runs `go test -cover -json` against configured scope + threshold (default 30%). Advisory-fallthrough when `go` binary missing. M23 T5.1 closes F22 (coverage_pct not measured).
test-deletion	gates	Guards deletion of test files against coverage loss.
test-pyramid	gates	Validates the unit/integration/e2e test-pyramid balance.
test-skip-absent-path	gates	B-180/B-183/B-186/B-188: a test under infra/tests/ or api/ may not skip on an absent path without declaring it — a skip guarded by a path that does not exist is unconditional in practice, and everything below it is dead code. Reads the probe inline, through same-package predicates (functions or unambiguously-named methods) that delegate to one another, in either arm of the guard; and reads the SKIP wherever it sits — inside a function literal, a defer, a select or type-switch clause, in the condition of a tag-less switch case, one same-package call away from the arm, or handed to a helper as an argument. Past its depth bound it reports UNRESOLVED and fails rather than going quiet.
test-skip-unconditional	gates	B-184: a test under infra/tests/ or api/ may not open with a BARE t.Skip — no guard at all — and carry statements underneath it. A skip aborts the function, so everything below it is unreachable code that reads like a live assertion; two such tests had asserted nothing since T1.4 and six more sat in t.Run subtests. The unguarded half of the class test-skip-absent-path guards. Its pin holds live anchors, so a detector that stops recognising the shape goes red rather than quiet.
test-target-coverage	gates	Every PACKAGE with tests is run by a Taskfile target, or carries a NAMED exemption with a reason and a sunset. Package granularity, not module: a `./unit/...` marked the whole module covered while 41 files in three subtrees never ran (B-114). `go build` does not count (B-087/B-088).
test-targets	gates	Verifies Taskfile test targets exist and are wired.
loopzero-api-openbao-approle-envfrom	gates	T6.1 of plan 2026-06-10-j22-openbao-transit-eso-sync: loopzero-api chart unconditionally wires AppRole secret_id via envFrom.secretRef to K8s Secret loopzero-openbao-approle (optional=true). Anti-hardcode gate — NO inline value: for OPENBAO_VAULT_SECRET_ID. Renders chart via helm template subprocess (Anti-Pattern #8 legitimate); advisory fallthrough when helm absent. M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/helm/loopzero-api-openbao-approle-envfrom_test.sh.
loopzero-external-secrets-chart-sanity	gates	iter 23 chart-sanity contract for infra/helm/loopzero-external-secrets: renders 5 canonical envs (vault-local/standalone-multi/dev/drill/prod) + inventory-based ExternalSecret count parity + metadata.name uniqueness + refreshInterval + loopzero-secrets-secrets ClusterSecretStore refs + vaultBinaryOverride api/secrets/* resolution (≥3) + envName empty fail-fast + no operators/gitea path leak. 8 assertions. Advisory when helm absent. M-Migrate2 2026-07-10 M16 T3.5 Wave 2 replaces infra/tests/check-loopzero-external-secrets-chart-sanity_test.sh.
loopzero-external-secrets-creation-policy	gates	iter 20 P0 regression: infra/helm/loopzero-external-secrets renders ExternalSecret CRs with creationPolicy: Orphan (NEVER Owner — Owner+blockOwnerDeletion cascade-deletes K8s Secrets on chart uninstall). 4 assertions: ≥1 ES CR + zero Owner + deletionPolicy Retain ≥ Orphan + Orphan==ES CR count. Advisory when helm absent. M-Migrate2 2026-07-10 M16 T3.6 Wave 2 replaces infra/tests/check-loopzero-external-secrets-creation-policy_test.sh.
transit-coverage	gates	Enforces the OpenBao transit dispatcher invariant (encrypt/decrypt-for-store).
trivy-scan	gates	Runs Trivy CVE scanning on filesystem/images.
trufflehog-scan	gates	Refuses a new unadjudicated secret candidate, a live secret, or a scan that could not run.
unhomed-logic	gates	Forbids un-homed operational logic that belongs in a pkg/quality gate.
values-duplicate-keys	gates	A Helm values file must not declare one mapping key twice (Helm silently keeps only the last).
vap-delete-guardrail	gates	Boundary resources (Application/Tenant/Environment/ClusterCredential) AND their CRDs are protected from unauthorized DELETE (D4).
vault-bootstrap-unseal-loop	gates	Regression guard for the 2026-06-15 canonical fix of vault-bootstrap-dev.sh Steps 2+3 (rc-independent bao-status parse, capitalized 'True' compare, no lowercase 'true' fallback). M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-vault-bootstrap-unseal-loop_test.sh.
vault-prom-alerts	gates	T8.4 hermetic contract for PrometheusRule vault-audit-alerts: YAML parses + all 4 P1 alerts declared (VaultAuthFailureRateHigh + VaultPolicyDenialRateHigh + VaultSealedOrDown + VaultAuditLogStalled) + all severity=critical + all runbook_url annotations + all team=platform-security + all domain=vault + VaultAuditLogStalled carries invariant "audit-log-must-flow" (high-confidence adversary signal). M-Migrate2 2026-07-10 M16 T3.3 Wave 2 replaces infra/tests/check-vault-prom-alerts_test.sh.
webhook-canonical-path	gates	Blocks the /engine/api/v1/webhooks/github 301 trap; enforces the canonical /api/v1/webhooks/github (M-Migrate2 2026-07-07 replaces infra/tests/check-webhook-canonical-path_test.sh).
worker-csp	gates	Cloudflare static worker CSP must not permit inline/eval script (#235).
